# azd writes environment state here (config.json and per-environment directories
# holding .env files). That state is machine-local and must never be committed.
*

# deployment-plan.md is not azd state. It is a checked-in part of this fixture:
# the deployment gate fails with `deploymentPlanMissing` without it, so a fresh
# checkout that lacks it would fail the golden case for the wrong reason.
!.gitignore
!deployment-plan.md
